    "description": "Take Control of Your Home Financing\r\n\u2022 Check eligibility and get preapproved for a loan that meets your homebuying goals.\r\n\u2022 Connect directly with your personal loan team through text, email or phone.\r\n\r\nStay on Track\r\n\u2022 View and complete tasks added to the MyVU to-do list.\r\n\u2022 Take and upload photos of requested documents straight from your phone\u2019s camera.\r\n\r\nClose Confidently\r\n\u2022 Sign your mortgage documents electronically and save time on Closing Day.\r\n\u2022 Access the Bill Pay Center to set up autopay, make payments and more.\r\n\r\nVeteransUnited.com | 1-800-884-5560 | 1400 Veterans United Drive, Columbia, MO 65203 Veterans United Home Loans NMLS # 1907 (www.nmlsconsumeraccess.org). A VA approved lender; Not endorsed or sponsored by the Dept. of Veterans Affairs or any government agency. Licensed in all 50 states. For State Licensing information, please visit www.veteransunited.com/licenses. Equal Opportunity Lender.",
